s to data/people for Source          [x] Realistic build expectation this quarter\n[x] Quarterly review is on the calendar"}, {"id": "fp-0", "type": "text", "x": 530, "y": 268, "width": 300, "height": 42, "angle": 0, "strokeColor": "#000000", "backgroundColor": "transparent", "fillStyle": "solid", "strokeWidth": 1, "strokeStyle": "solid", "roughness": 0, "opacity": 100, "groupIds": [], "roundness": null, "seed": 7100, "version": 1, "versionNonce": 7100, "isDeleted": false, "boundElements": [], "updated": 1, "link": null, "locked": false, "text": "Only Elena can quote. 3.8 days vs rivals' 24-48h. ~$558K/yr.", "rawText": "Only Elena can quote. 3.8 days vs rivals' 24-48h. ~$558K/yr.", "fontSize": 11, "fontFamily": 1, "textAlign": "left", "verticalAlign": "top", "baseline": 9, "containerId": null, "originalText": "Only Elena can quote. 3.8 days vs rivals' 24-48h. ~$558K/yr."}, {"id": "fp-1", "type": "text", "x": 530, "y": 312, "width": 300, "height": 42, "angle": 0, "strokeColor": "#000000", "backgroundColor": "transparent", "fillStyle": "solid", "strokeWidth": 1, "strokeStyle": "solid", "roughness": 0, "opacity": 100, "groupIds": [], "roundness": null, "seed": 7101, "version": 1, "versionNonce": 7101, "isDeleted": false, "boundElements": [], "updated": 1, "link": null, "locked": false, "text": "Pricing in Elena's 147-row sheet; fab know-how in Dave's head; JobBOSS not linked to CRM.", "rawText": "Pricing in Elena's 147-row sheet; fab know-how in Dave's head; JobBOSS not linked to CRM.", "fontSize": 11, "fontFamily": 1, "textAlign": "left", "verticalAlign": "top", "baseline": 9, "containerId": null, "originalText": "Pricing in Elena's 147-row sheet; fab know-how in Dave's head; JobBOSS not linked to CRM."}, {"id": "fp-2", "type": "text", "x": 530, "y": 356, "width": 300, "height": 42, "angle": 0, "strokeColor": "#000000", "backgroundColor": "transparent", "fillStyle": "solid", "strokeWidth": 1, "strokeStyle": "solid", "roughness": 0, "opacity": 100, "groupIds": [], "roundness": null, "seed": 7102, "version": 1, "versionNonce": 7102, "isDeleted": false, "boundElements": [], "updated": 1, "link": null, "locked": false, "text": "AI drafts from CRM+ERP+notes; Elena approves; Ty initiates; Dave on exceptions.", "rawText": "AI drafts from CRM+ERP+notes; Elena approves; Ty initiates; Dave on exceptions.", "fontSize": 11, "fontFamily": 1, "textAlign": "left", "verticalAlign": "top", "baseline": 9, "containerId": null, "originalText": "AI drafts from CRM+ERP+notes; Elena approves; Ty initiates; Dave on exceptions."}, {"id": "fp-3", "type": "text", "x": 530, "y": 400, "width": 300, "height": 42, "angle": 0, "strokeColor": "#000000", "backgroundColor": "transparent", "fillStyle": "solid", "strokeWidth": 1, "strokeStyle": "solid", "roughness": 0, "opacity": 100, "groupIds": [], "roundness": null, "seed": 7103, "version": 1, "versionNonce": 7103, "isDeleted": false, "boundElements": [], "updated": 1, "link": null, "locked": false, "text": "Low-code: n8n links HubSpot to JobBOSS to Claude. No quote ships without Elena (60-day calibration).", "rawText": "Low-code: n8n links HubSpot to JobBOSS to Claude. No quote ships without Elena (60-day calibration).", "fontSize": 11, "fontFamily": 1, "textAlign": "left", "verticalAlign": "top", "baseline": 9, "containerId": null, "originalText": "Low-code: n8n links HubSpot to JobBOSS to Claude. No quote ships without Elena (60-day calibration)."}, {"id": "fp-4", "type": "text", "x": 530, "y": 442, "width": 300, "height": 42, "angle": 0, "strokeColor": "#000000", "backgroundColor": "transparent", "fillStyle": "solid", "strokeWidth": 1, "strokeStyle": "solid", "roughness": 0, "opacity": 100, "groupIds": [], "roundness": null, "seed": 7104, "version": 1, "versionNonce": 7104, "isDeleted": false, "boundElements": [], "updated": 1, "link": null, "locked": false, "text": "Target under 8h (was 3.8 days). Test: 30 quotes in 30 days.", "rawText": "Target under 8h (was 3.8 days). Test: 30 quotes in 30 days.", "fontSize": 11, "fontFamily": 1, "textAlign": "left", "verticalAlign": "top", "baseline": 9, "containerId": null, "originalText": "Target under 8h (was 3.8 days). Test: 30 quotes in 30 days."}, {"id": "fp-5", "type": "text", "x": 530, "y": 474, "width": 300, "height": 42, "angle": 0, "strokeColor": "#000000", "backgroundColor": "transparent", "fillStyle": "solid", "strokeWidth": 1, "strokeStyle": "solid", "roughness": 0, "opacity": 100, "groupIds": [], "roundness": null, "seed": 7105, "version": 1, "versionNonce": 7105, "isDeleted": false, "boundElements": [], "updated": 1, "link": null, "locked": false, "text": "Elena: maker to reviewer. Notes.xlsx to shared KB. Next Sprint: scheduling.", "rawText": "Elena: maker to reviewer. Notes.xlsx to shared KB. Next Sprint: scheduling.", "fontSize": 11, "fontFamily": 1, "textAlign": "left", "verticalAlign": "top", "baseline": 9, "containerId": null, "originalText": "Elena: maker to reviewer. Notes.xlsx to shared KB. Next Sprint: scheduling."}], "appState": {"viewBackgroundColor": "#ffffff", "gridSize": null}, "files": {}}